{
  "title": "Step Functions · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 작업의 순서·분기·재시도·실패 처리를 워크플로로 정의한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Step Functions</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">States and Amazon States Language</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#standard-workflows\">Standard Workflows</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#express-workflows\">Express Workflows</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#request-response-run-a-job-and-callback\">Request Response, Run a Job and Callback</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#retry-catch-and-timeouts\">Retry, Catch and Timeouts</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#parallel-and-map-states\">Parallel and Map States</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#iam-and-execution-history\">IAM and Execution History</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>52 / 62</span></div><h1>Step Functions</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Step Functions는 여러 작업의 실행 상태·분기·병렬 처리·Retry를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">State Machine</a>으로 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>뿐 아니라 지원 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 서비스 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 통합하여 Workflow를 구성한다.</p><p>Queue는 작업을 전달·보관하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">State Machine</a>은 어느 단계가 성공·실패했는지 관리한다. 긴 업무 절차의 상태를 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>의 Memory에만 보관하지 않아도 된다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"정상 실행과 보상\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>정상 실행과 보상</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Normal path</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Payment Task</strong><small>결제 수행</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Inventory Task</strong><small>재고 예약</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Shipment Task</strong><small>배송 생성</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Failure path</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Task error</strong><small>지원 오류 탐지</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Retry / Catch</strong><small>Backoff·실패 분기</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Compensation</strong><small>환불 등 업무 Logic 실행</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Workflow의 상태 관리가 외부 결제의 Idempotency를 대신하지 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"states-and-amazon-states-language\"><h2>States and Amazon States Language<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Task, Choice, Parallel, Map, Wait, Pass, Succeed, Fail 같은 State로 Workflow를 표현한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">JSONPath</a> 또는 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">JSONata</a>로 입력·출력을 변환한다. State Input·Output 크기와 서비스별 Payload 한도를 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"standard-workflows\"><h2>Standard Workflows<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#standard-workflows\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>장기 실행·감사 가능한 실행 이력과 Exactly-once Workflow Execution 모델을 제공한다. 최대 1년의 실행과 지원 .sync·Callback 통합을 사용할 수 있다. 명시한 Retry로 Task가 재실행될 수 있으므로 외부 Side Effect의 Idempotency는 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"express-workflows\"><h2>Express Workflows<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#express-workflows\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>최대 5분의 짧고 높은 처리량 Workflow에 적합하다. Asynchronous Express는 At-least-once, Synchronous Express는 At-most-once 실행 모델을 구분한다. Standard와 지원 Integration·이력·과금 방식이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"request-response-run-a-job-and-callback\"><h2>Request Response, Run a Job and Callback<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#request-response-run-a-job-and-callback\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Request Response는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 응답 후 다음 단계로 진행한다. .sync는 지원 Job 완료를, Task Token Callback은 외부 완료 통지를 기다린다. Human Approval 같은 긴 대기는 지원 Standard Callback을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"retry-catch-and-timeouts\"><h2>Retry, Catch and Timeouts<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#retry-catch-and-timeouts\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Retry는 오류 유형·Backoff로 재실행하고 Catch는 실패 경로로 이동한다. Timeout·Heartbeat로 멈춘 작업을 감지한다. 결제 취소 같은 Compensation은 Business Logic으로 설계해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"parallel-and-map-states\"><h2>Parallel and Map States<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#parallel-and-map-states\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Parallel은 독립 Branch를, Map은 Item 집합 처리를 수행한다. Inline·Distributed Map의 실행 규모·이력·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#data-sources-and-datasets\">Data Source</a> 조건이 다르다. Downstream Rate Limit을 고려해 동시성을 제한한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iam-and-execution-history\"><h2>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> and Execution History<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#iam-and-execution-history\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">State Machine</a> Role에 호출할 서비스 권한을 부여한다. Execution History·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> Log로 실패 단계와 입력·출력을 조사한다. Secret·개인정보가 이력에 기록되는 범위를 관리한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>주문 검증 → 결제 → 재고 예약 → 배송의 단계와 실패 시 결제 취소를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/#states-and-amazon-states-language\">State Machine</a>으로 표현한다. 각 Task는 주문 ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span> 기준으로 안전하게 재시도할 수 있게 한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>실패 시 재시도·보상 흐름을 관리하는 오케스트레이션에 초점을 둔다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/step-functions/latest/dg/welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">step-functions/latest/dg/welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q076\" data-question=\"Q076\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q076</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workflow must explicitly handle branching, retries, and compensation across payment, inventory reservation, and shipment creation. Which service should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Step Functions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q076\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>는 다단계 워크플로의 상태·분기·재시도를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q071\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q077\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q077\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q073\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q092\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">이전 용어 <b>SQS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">다음 용어 <b>Storage Gateway</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
